{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find Us Cats</i> is a new hidden object game starring our favorite feline friends!  Find dozens of cats in each level and aim for a high score in Level 1 of our free demo, the Planetarium. Don't forget to try out the Painting mode!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 1: The Planetarium </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the universe and the building, too, if you have time! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 25+ cats hidden within level 1 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare undocumented cats may be lurking throughout the demo, but only for those brave enough to scour the environment carefully </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to expand the game further based on the feedback gathered from the demo, so please share your thoughts on the forums or in a review.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Find Us Cats is releasing this March in 2026!\u00a0 Wishlist to be notified. </i></strong>\ud83d\ude38</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3184730?t=1772578347","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772578347","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184730/3d367732de7b8ee9b00fb061d36e12984ededf72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772578347","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184730/3d367732de7b8ee9b00fb061d36e12984ededf72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772578347","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch On